{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/transition-carries-the-sound-walk",
  "seed": "Pick the edit point between the sample talk and b-roll butted on after it and put a transition on it (the click and the picker themselves are transition-picker-at-a-cut-walk's to prove), and the sound does what the picture does: a cross dissolve cross-fades the two clips' sound at equal power over its length, a dip to black takes the sound through silence on the cut, and a hard cut switches the sound right on the cut. Checked on the very plan the player and the export are handed, at Next defaults, no flag set.",
  "setup": {
    "forget": [
      "all"
    ],
    "scratch": [
      "sample:recording as b-roll.mp4"
    ]
  },
